                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins and shield. May have throwing spears (+1). Light Infantry on foot (not in the British Kingdoms composition, where they are ordinary heavy infantry with up to +3 rank bonus). Warband rules 1 and 2. Run for the Woods in the Welsh and Dumnonian compositions. (The Age of Arthur p.40)</characteristic>
